INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (5747,0,'2026-08-17 14:39:43','2026-08-17 17:39:43','<p><strong>Porque tenés todo lo que necesitás en cada neumático:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Agarre</li>\n<li>Durabilidad</li>\n<li>Manejo</li>\n<li>Confort</li>\n<li>Baja sonoridad</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Se combinan cientos de elementos para fabricar tu neumático. Ofrecemos una <strong>garantía de 5 años</strong> desde la fecha de fabricación, contra defectos de fábrica.</p>\n<p>Headway cuenta con importantes certificados de calidad como: LSQA, ISO9001, TS16949, GB/T24001, GB/T28001, 3C, DOT, ECE, REACH, LABEL, INMETRO, GCC y SONCAP.</p>\n<p>Produce anualmente unos <strong>30 millones de neumáticos</strong> para pasajeros.</p>','Por qué elegir neumáticos Headway?','','publish','open','open','','por-que-elegir-neumaticos-headway','','','2026-08-17 14:39:43','2026-08-17 17:39:43','',0,'http://localhost:8881/2026/08/17/por-que-elegir-neumaticos-headway/',0,'post','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (5748,0,'2026-08-17 14:39:43','2026-08-17 17:39:43','<p>Descuentos especiales para <strong>funcionarios de COETC</strong>:</p>\n<h3>Servicios</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Alineación: 15%</li>\n<li>Balanceo: 15%</li>\n<li>Mecánica ligera: 15%</li>\n<li>Chequeos: 10%</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Productos</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Neumáticos: 15%</li>\n<li>Baterías: 10%</li>\n<li>Llantas: 5%</li>\n</ul>','Descuentos para funcionarios de COETC','','publish','open','open','','descuentos-para-funcionarios-de-coetc','','','2026-08-17 14:39:43','2026-08-17 17:39:43','',0,'http://localhost:8881/2026/08/17/descuentos-para-funcionarios-de-coetc/',0,'post','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (5749,0,'2026-08-17 15:43:01','2026-08-17 18:43:01','[vc_row css=".vc_custom_1472016399122{margin-top: 30px !important;margin-bottom: 51px !important;}"][vc_column width="1/2" el_class="stm-col-pad-right"][vc_single_image image="4278" img_size="full" stm_fancybox="yes" css=".vc_custom_1471956723664{margin-bottom: 35px !important;}"][/vc_column][vc_column width="1/2" el_class="stm-col-pad-left"][vc_column_text]\n<h3 style="margin-bottom: 18px;">WELCOME TO THE <span style="color: #e71919;">MOTORS</span></h3>\n<h5 style="margin-bottom: 22px;">Before we get ahead of ourselves, we want to welcome you to Loeber Motors. While nothing can replace thing on-the-lot experience.</h5>\n<p style="margin-bottom: 26px;">We appreciate you taking the time today to visit our web site. Our goal is to give you an interactive tour of our new and used inventory, as well as allow you to conveniently get a quote, schedule a service appointment, or apply for financing. The search for a luxury Motorcycle is filled with high expectations. Undoubtedly, that has a lot to do with the vehicles you are considering, but at Motors, we think you should also have pretty high expectations for your dealership.</p>\n<span style="color: #888888;"><em> — MIKEY DIOKLES, President of Motors</em></span>[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=".vc_custom_1445594570930{margin-bottom: 83px !important;}"][vc_column width="1/2" el_class="stm-col-pad-right"][vc_column_text css=".vc_custom_1445496956815{margin-bottom: 23px !important;}"]\n<h3>CORE VALUES</h3>\n[/vc_column_text][vc_separator css=".vc_custom_1445496980428{margin-bottom: 19px !important;}"][vc_column_text css=".vc_custom_1448951164713{margin-bottom: 24px !important;}"]<span style="color: #888888; font-size: 13px;">We go through extensive factory training so that we may provide you with the knowledge you need to make an educated decision in choosing the vehicle that is right for your lifestyle.</span>[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text]\n<ul class="list-style-1">\n 	<li>Stress-free finance department.</li>\n 	<li>Robust selection of popular vehicles.</li>\n 	<li>350 offers on site, trusted by a community.</li>\n 	<li>Maintain your Motorcycle to stay safe on the road</li>\n 	<li>We know how to handle a wide range of Motorcycle services.</li>\n</ul>\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column width="1/2" el_class="stm-col-pad-left"][vc_single_image image="4278" img_size="full" stm_fancybox="yes" css=".vc_custom_1471956738040{margin-bottom: 35px !important;}"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row full_width="stretch_row" css=".vc_custom_1445583749143{margin-bottom: 83px !important;padding-top: 48px !important;padding-bottom: 31px !important;background-color: #232628 !important;}"][vc_column][vc_custom_heading text="MEDIA GALLERY" font_container="tag:h2|text_align:center|color:%23ffffff" use_theme_fonts="yes" css=".vc_custom_1472015242946{margin-bottom: 30px !important;}"][stm_carousel image_size="270x180" images="4278,4278,4278,4278"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column width="1/2" el_class="stm-col-pad-right" css=".vc_custom_1445583873131{margin-bottom: 35px !important;}"][vc_custom_heading text="OUR ADVANTAGES" font_container="tag:h3|text_align:left" use_theme_fonts="yes" css=".vc_custom_1448951634714{margin-bottom: 24px !important;}"][vc_tta_accordion c_icon="chevron" active_section="1"][vc_tta_section i_icon_fontawesome="stm-icon-car_sale" title="Do You want to sell a Motorcycle?" tab_id="1445577012477-c2089919-d41f" add_icon="true"][vc_column_text]What’s your Motorcycle worth? Receive the absolute best value for your trade-in vehicle. We even handle all paperwork. Schedule your appointment today![/vc_column_text][/vc_tta_section][vc_tta_section i_icon_fontawesome="stm-icon-key" title="Are You looking for a new Motorcycle?" tab_id="1445577012778-7f50c834-615e" add_icon="true"][vc_column_text]Our Motorcycles are delivered fully-registered with all requirements completed. We\'ll deliver your Motorcycle wherever you are.[/vc_column_text][/vc_tta_section][vc_tta_section i_icon_fontawesome="stm-icon-gear" title="How to schedule a service online?" tab_id="1445577154864-e8053705-41fb" add_icon="true"][vc_column_text]Maecenas consectetur nulla dolor, ac porttitor nunc hendrerit quis. Proin vitae rhoncus purus, id commodo massa. Aliquam erat volutpat.[/vc_column_text][/vc_tta_section][/vc_tta_accordion][/vc_column][vc_column width="1/2" el_class="stm-col-pad-left" css=".vc_custom_1445583880769{margin-bottom: 35px !important;}"][vc_custom_heading text="CUSTOMER TESTIMONIALS" font_container="tag:h3|text_align:left" use_theme_fonts="yes" css=".vc_custom_1445583787565{margin-bottom: 24px !important;}"][stm_testimonials][stm_testimonial image="4278" author="Michael Doe" author_car="2015 Honda Civic LX"]\n<h5>Motors is absolutely wonderful!</h5>\nI can’t believe it was this easy to sell my Motorcycle to you guys. You definitely made this as simple as advertised. Whenever my family moves back to the states, we would certainly love to use Motors theme again![/stm_testimonial][stm_testimonial image="4278" author="Baxter Ion" author_car="Chevy Spark"]\n<h5>Motors is absolutely wonderful!</h5>\nI picked out my Motorcycle on the website, purchased it, and a few days later it was delivered to my home exactly as described by the inspector. There were no surprises and no hassles. They are selling quality Motorcycles[/stm_testimonial][/stm_testimonials][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row full_width="stretch_row" css=".vc_custom_1472014784612{margin-bottom: 0px !important;padding-top: 48px !important;padding-bottom: 15px !important;background-color: #232628 !important;}"][vc_column][vc_custom_heading text="OUR TEAM" font_container="tag:h2|text_align:center" use_theme_fonts="yes" css=".vc_custom_1472015233494{margin-bottom: 30px !important;}"][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner width="1/2" offset="vc_col-lg-3"][stm_our_team image_size="full" image="4278" name="Lennox Wardell" position="Chief Executive Officer" email="ceo@motors.com" phone="+1-913-677-74-27"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width="1/2" offset="vc_col-lg-3"][stm_our_team image_size="full" image="4278" name="Sarah Odegard" position="President of Finance" email="s.odegard@motors.com"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width="1/2" offset="vc_col-lg-3"][stm_our_team image_size="full" image="4278" name="Lars Jakuba" position="Executive Vice President" phone="+1-234-567-89-00"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width="1/2" offset="vc_col-lg-3"][stm_our_team image_size="full" image="4278" name="Mikey Diokles" position="Sales Manager"][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row full_width="stretch_row" css=".vc_custom_1472015218432{padding-top: 30px !important;padding-bottom: 30px !important;background-color: #243136 !important;}"][vc_column][stm_our_partners image_size="140x70" image="4278" number_to_show="6"][/vc_column][/vc_row]','La empresa','','inherit','closed','closed','','370-revision-v1','','','2026-08-17 15:43:01','2026-08-17 18:43:01','',370,'http://localhost:8881/?p=5749',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (5750,0,'2026-08-17 15:52:30','2026-08-17 18:52:30','<div class="wsf-page">\n<p>Todo comenzÃ³ por la dÃ©cada de los 80 cuando los fundadores de Duna empezaron con la comercializaciÃ³n de cÃ¡maras y neumÃ¡ticos de producciÃ³n nacional, marca FUNSA.</p>\n<div class="wsf-timeline">\n	<div class="wsf-timeline-item"><span class="wsf-timeline-year">Nacimiento Â· DÃ©cada del 80</span><p>Comienzo de la comercializaciÃ³n de cÃ¡maras y neumÃ¡ticos de producciÃ³n nacional, marca FUNSA.</p></div>\n	<div class="wsf-timeline-item"><span class="wsf-timeline-year">1991</span><p>Debido al crecimiento de las ventas, se abrieron las puertas del local comercial bajo el nombre de <strong>DUNA NeumÃ¡ticos</strong>. Se incorporaron los servicios de colocaciÃ³n de neumÃ¡ticos y cÃ¡maras y los trabajos de reparaciÃ³n de neumÃ¡ticos.</p></div>\n	<div class="wsf-timeline-item"><span class="wsf-timeline-year">1999</span><p>Se incorporaron todos los servicios de <strong>balanceo y alineaciÃ³n</strong>; tambiÃ©n comenzamos con la importaciÃ³n de neumÃ¡ticos y cÃ¡maras de China.</p></div>\n	<div class="wsf-timeline-item"><span class="wsf-timeline-year">2010</span><p>DUNA NeumÃ¡ticos comienza a representar las marcas <strong>Vulcaflex</strong> y <strong>Headway</strong> en Uruguay. Vulcaflex: una de las fÃ¡bricas mÃ¡s prestigiosas de Brasil en insumos para gomerÃ­a y reconstrucciÃ³n (parches, soluciones, bandas, cojÃ­n y mÃ¡s). Headway: una de las fÃ¡bricas de China mÃ¡s exitosas en producciÃ³n de neumÃ¡ticos para todo el mundo.</p></div>\n	<div class="wsf-timeline-item"><span class="wsf-timeline-year">Actualidad</span><p>Hoy DUNA NeumÃ¡ticos es una empresa de renombre a nivel nacional donde se comercializa una gama sumamente amplia de productos. Gracias a su personal calificado y a la maquinaria moderna se realizan todo tipo de servicios a todo tipo de vehÃ­culo.</p></div>\n</div>\n<a class="wsf-cta" href="mailto:info@duna.com.uy?subject=Trabaja%20con%20nosotros">Trabaja con nosotros!</a>\n<h2>Nuestros clientes dicen</h2>\n<div class="wsf-testimonials">\n	<div class="wsf-testimonial"><p>"Excelente servicio y atenciÃ³n, muy allegados al publico."</p><span class="wsf-testimonial-author">Federico</span></div>\n	<div class="wsf-testimonial"><p>"Excelente servicio y atenciÃ³n."</p><span class="wsf-testimonial-author">Osvaldo Madera</span></div>\n	<div class="wsf-testimonial"><p>"Excelente atenciÃ³n. Son muy cordiales y atentos a todos los detalles. Sin dudas volverÃ©!"</p><span class="wsf-testimonial-author">Chiari Duchini</span></div>\n	<div class="wsf-testimonial"><p>"Excelente atenciÃ³n, muy recomendable."</p><span class="wsf-testimonial-author">Eduardo GonzÃ¡lez</span></div>\n</div>\n<h2>Clientes</h2>\n<div class="wsf-stats">\n	<div class="wsf-stat"><span class="wsf-stat-num">+10.000</span><span class="wsf-stat-label">Clientes felices</span></div>\n	<div class="wsf-stat"><span class="wsf-stat-num">+15</span><span class="wsf-stat-label">El equipo</span></div>\n	<div class="wsf-stat"><span class="wsf-stat-num">25+</span><span class="wsf-stat-label">Distribuidores</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class="wsf-stats">\n	<div class="wsf-stat"><span class="wsf-stat-num">48%</span><span class="wsf-stat-label">Clientes personales</span></div>\n	<div class="wsf-stat"><span class="wsf-stat-num">37%</span><span class="wsf-stat-label">Clientes corporativos</span></div>\n	<div class="wsf-stat"><span class="wsf-stat-num">15%</span><span class="wsf-stat-label">Otros</span></div>\n</div>\n<h2>Preguntas frecuentes</h2>\n<div class="wsf-faq">\n	<div class="wsf-faq-item"><h4>Â¿QuÃ© cubre la garantÃ­a que ofrecen?</h4><p>GarantÃ­a para todos los trabajos en nuestros servicios: 1 aÃ±o o 10.000 km. NeumÃ¡ticos: 5 aÃ±os contra defectos de fÃ¡brica, desde la fecha de fabricaciÃ³n. ReparaciÃ³n de neumÃ¡ticos: depende del neumÃ¡tico y la reparaciÃ³n.</p></div>\n	<div class="wsf-faq-item"><h4>Â¿QuÃ© garantÃ­a tienen los neumÃ¡ticos Headway?</h4><p>Cuentan con 50.000 kilÃ³metros de garantÃ­a o 5 aÃ±os desde la fecha de fabricaciÃ³n.</p></div>\n	<div class="wsf-faq-item"><h4>Â¿Los neumÃ¡ticos Headway son confiables?</h4><p>Hoy en dÃ­a son los que mÃ¡s vendemos. Es reconocida mundialmente y de muy buena calidad. No han habido reclamos desde que se empezaron a importar en el aÃ±o 2012. Su relaciÃ³n calidad-precio es muy difÃ­cil de superar.</p></div>\n	<div class="wsf-faq-item"><h4>Â¿Los productos Vulcaflex son confiables?</h4><p>Es uno de los mejores productores de insumos para reparaciÃ³n de neumÃ¡ticos (parches, soluciones, pastas, cojÃ­n, entre otros). Hoy somos representantes de la marca en Uruguay y vendemos para todo el paÃ­s.</p></div>\n	<div class="wsf-faq-item"><h4>Â¿QuÃ© kilometraje duran los neumÃ¡ticos?</h4><p>Depende de la medida del neumÃ¡tico, pero si se le realizan los service correspondientes al vehÃ­culo cada 10.000 kms, su vida Ãºtil promedio es de 63.000 kilÃ³metros.</p></div>\n	<div class="wsf-faq-item"><h4>Â¿Venden solo neumÃ¡ticos de auto?</h4><p>Contamos con neumÃ¡ticos para todo tipo de vehÃ­culo: moto, cuadriciclos, auto, camioneta, camiÃ³n, bus, agrÃ­cola y vial.</p></div>\n	<div class="wsf-faq-item"><h4>Â¿QuÃ© servicios brindan?</h4><p>Todos los necesarios para mantener su vehÃ­culo a punto: balanceo, alineaciÃ³n, cambio de aceite, cambio de correas, cambio de filtros, mecÃ¡nica y mucho mÃ¡s. A nivel industrial realizamos reparaciones de neumÃ¡ticos de gran porte.</p></div>\n	<div class="wsf-faq-item"><h4>Â¿Reparan neumÃ¡ticos?</h4><p>Reparamos todo tipo de neumÃ¡ticos; contamos con el personal y la maquinaria necesaria para hacerlo.</p></div>\n	<div class="wsf-faq-item"><h4>Â¿Venden al por mayor?</h4><p>SÃ­, vendemos todos nuestros productos al por mayor (neumÃ¡ticos, cÃ¡maras, parches, cementos, herramientas, contrapesos, llantas, entre otros). Ponete en contacto por precio especial.</p></div>\n</div>\n<h2>Oficina / Online</h2>\n<div class="wsf-contact-block">\n	<p>Nuestros gerentes estarÃ¡n encantados de responder a todas sus preguntas. Las consultas se pueden realizar no solo en la oficina o por telÃ©fono, sino tambiÃ©n en lÃ­nea.</p>\n	<p><a class="wsf-cta" href="https://wa.me/59823644300" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Contactanos por WhatsApp</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n','La empresa','','inherit','closed','closed','','370-revision-v1','','','2026-08-17 15:52:30','2026-08-17 18:52:30','',370,'http://localhost:8881/?p=5750',0,'revision','',0);
